                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''">绍兴市人事局<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN>绍兴市教育局关于做好<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''">中专及中小学教师专业技术资格推荐评审工作的通知</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">各县（市、区）人事局、教育局<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>市直有关部门，市属学校：<SPAN lang=EN-US> <BR></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">   </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">为做好<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年我市中等职业学校、普通中小学（幼儿园）教师和教育管理、实验人员的专业技术资格推荐评审工作，根据省、市有关职评文件精神，现就做好推荐评审工作的有关事项通知如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">一、总体要求<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; tab-stops: 47.25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（一）坚持正确的政策导向。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">按照“坚持标准、保证质量、全面考核、择优晋升”的原则，结合绩效考核和事业单位岗位设置的实施，严格把握推荐评审质量关。进一步完善评价标准，创新评价机制，鼓励优秀人才脱颖而出，充分调动广大中小学教师的积极性，为全面实施素质教育提供制度保障和人才支持。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（二）坚持以德为先的评审理念。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">坚持育人为本、德育为先，注重教师的师德素养，把践行《中小学教师职业道德规范》作为教师职称晋升的首要条件。在师德考核中，必须明确教师应自觉抵制有偿家教，不得以任何理由、任何方式影响教育教学任务的完成、干扰正常教育教学秩序、损害学生利益。要通过评审，促进广大教师自觉践行新时期师德规范，爱国守法、爱岗敬业，忠于职守，不做有悖于教师职业道德的事，努力展示新时期教师的良好形象，切实维护正常的教育教学秩序和社会稳定。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; tab-stops: 47.25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（三）突出教学中心地位，加强工作能力和教书育人实绩的评价。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">中小学教师专业技术水平评价要体现中小学教师职业特点，要适应实施素质教育和课程改革的新要求，注重日常教育教学方法和艺术，注重教育教学一线实践经历，切实改变过分强调论文倾向。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">      <B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">  </B></SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（四）继续向山区农村偏远学校倾斜</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">。山区农村偏远学校是推进教育均衡化的难点和重点。各县（市、区）不仅要为长期在山区农村偏远学校任教教师的职务晋升创造条件，而且要在同等条件下优先予以晋升，农村学校中、高级教师的通过率原则上不低于城镇教师。凡<?xml:namespace prefix = st1 ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /><st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="1" Month="1" Year="1970"><SPAN lang=EN-US>1970</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate>以后出生的城镇中小学教师，晋升高级教师资格时，必须有在农村或欠发达地区支教一年及以上的经历；中心城市中小学教师，也应有支援薄弱学校教学的经历。具体办法和要求由各县（市、区）结合当地实际制定，报市教育局政治处备案。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">二、评审委员会设置<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">（一）省教育厅</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">组建的“省中等专业学校教师高级专业技术资格评审委员会”负责评审中等专业学校高级讲师、中小学校教育管理副研究员、高级实验师资格；“省中学高级（小中高）资格评审委员会”负责评审小学、幼儿园教师的中学高级教师资格。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">（二）绍兴市人事局、教育局负责组建“绍兴市中学教师高级资格评审委员会”和“绍兴市中等专业学校教师中级资格评审委员会”和“市直属中学教师中级资格评审委员会”。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">“绍兴市中学教师高级资格评审委员会”负责全市中学高级教师资格的评审；“绍兴市中等专业学校教师中级资格评审委员会”负责全市中专讲师和中小学校教育管理助理研究员评审及相应高级资格的推荐。“市直属中学教师中级资格评审委员会”负责市直属中学中级资格的评审工作。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">（三）各县（市、区）应严格按照有关文件规定组建评委会，并同《评审对象资格审查花名册》一并报市人事部门审查后，方能召开评审会议。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">三、申报范围及条件<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">（一）申报对象</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; tab-stops: 47.25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、必须明确申报者所从事的工作岗位，对于工作岗位与所申报专业技术资格不相符的，不予受理和推荐。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、各教师系列（含教育管理、实验系列）专业技术资格的申报条件、相关问题的补充意见及有关</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">中小学教师申报中学高级教师教学业务水平考核办法</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">仍按</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">绍市教〔<SPAN lang=EN-US>2008</SPAN>〕<SPAN lang=EN-US>52</SPAN>号文件执行。继续教育除按原规定执行外，从<SPAN lang=EN-US>2009</SPAN>年起开展专业技术人员公需科目培训</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">（二）</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">初定专业技术资格的学历和任职时间规定，仍按人事部门的有关文件要求执行。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">（三）</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">继续对申报中、高级教师专业技术资格人员实行综合业绩量化考核，并按照《绍兴市</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">教师职务评审综合评价标准（试行）》（附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）进行逐项评分考核，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">考核所得分值将作为学科组推荐评审的参考依据。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">四、加大评审纪律和规定的执行力度<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">要进一步加强职评工作的监督检查，严格材料审核，认真执行职评材料公示制度，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">申报对象所在学校（单位）在正式材料上报前，必须将申报者对照《绍兴市教师专业技术资格评审综合评价标准》（试行）考核得分情况及其它职评材料在本学校（单位）公开栏公示<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>天以上（应设置意见箱、公示电话号码）。材料真实，符合申报条件，群众无异议的，方可推荐上报</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">。申报人员要对本人申报材料的真实性负责，申报人员在《专业技术资格评审材料的真实性保证书》（</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">上签字。所在学校（单位）要客观、公正、负责地审核材料，严格把关。对申报过程中有弄虚作假行为的，从次年起<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>年内不得申报专业技术资格，已取得资格的取消其评审结果，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">并视情节追究所在单位或有关人员的责任。<SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">五、</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 黑体"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">时间安排及</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''">报送材料要求<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; tab-stops: 414.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">各类申报材料应真实规范，书写清晰（或电脑打印），手续齐全，保证质量，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''">并符合规定的送审程序</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（具体材料要求见附件）。<U>有关评审表等表格可到省教育厅门户网站（</U></SPAN><U><SPAN lang=EN-GB style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB">http://www.zjedu.gov.cn/</SPAN></U><U><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">）</SPAN></U><U><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB">下载。</SPAN></U><SPAN lang=EN-GB style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">对不符合要求的，教师职务评委会办公室有权不予受理。市直中小学教师职称申报材料受理时间为<st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="30" Month="6" Year="2009"><SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate>－<st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="20" Month="7" Year="2009"><SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate>，各县（市、区）教育局于<st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="30" Month="7" Year="2010"><SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>日前</st1:chsdate>将中、高级职称申报材料送市职评中心初审，中学高级申报材料在各县中评委结束后即报市高评委办公室。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; tab-stops: 369.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''">其他未尽事宜，以及在评审推荐过程中遇到问题，请及时与市教育局政治处联系，联系人：朱伟明，联系电话：<SPAN lang=EN-US>85200223</SPAN>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; tab-stops: 369.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; tab-stops: 369.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"></SPAN><BR></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">附件：<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN>1</SPAN>、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">绍兴市教师专业技术资格评审综合评价标准（试行）</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 75pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-char-indent-count: 5.0; tab-stops: 369.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">、专业技术资格评审材料真实性保证书<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 75pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-char-indent-count: 5.0; tab-stops: 369.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">、支教情况登记表<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 75.45pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-char-indent-count: 5.03; tab-stops: 369.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">、中小学教师</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">专业技术资格</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">评审材料送审要求<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">     </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''">5</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''">、材料清单<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">      </SPAN><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                            </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''">二</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">〇</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">一</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">〇</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">年六月二十三</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman''">日<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
